":"And what will make you know what the night of Al-Qadr (Decree) is?"},"words":[{"id":1789,"position":1,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","translation":{"text":"And what","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"wamā","language_name":"english"}},{"id":1790,"position":2,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَدْرَىٰكَ","translation":{"text":"can make you know","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"adrāka","language_name":"english"}},{"id":1791,"position":3,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مَا","translation":{"text":"what","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"mā","language_name":"english"}},{"id":1792,"position":4,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لَيْلَةُ","translation":{"text":"(the) Night","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"laylatu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":1793,"position":5,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَدْرِ","translation":{"text":"(of) Power (is)","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-qadri","language_name":"english"}}]},{"id":6128,"verse_number":3,"verse_key":"97:3","juz_number":30,"rub_el_hizb_number":239,"hizb_number":60,"ruku_number":541,"manzil_number":7,"sajdah_number":null,"page_number":598,"text_uthmani":"لَيْلَةُ ٱلْقَدْرِ خَيْرٌ مِّنْ أَلْفِ شَهْرٍ","trs":{"20":"The Night of Decree is better than a thousand months.","85":"The Night of Glory is better than a thousand months;","22":"The Night of Power is better than a thousand months.","203":"The night of Al-Qadr (Decree) is better than a thousand months (i.e. worshipping Allâh in that night is better than worshipping Him a thousand months, i.e. 83 years and 4 months)."},"words":[{"id":2900,"position":1,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لَيْلَةُ","translation":{"text":"(The) Night","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"laylatu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":2901,"position":2,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَدْرِ","translation":{"text